        ecrm:P3_has_note    "Circular mat for a<i> huqqa</i> pipe, or tray cover, the ground is made of flattened gold wire, over which are applied a central field with floral designs in gold-wrapped thread, sequins and red and green spangles, and pearls, surrounded by a band of flowers made up of red and green spangles on a fringe of flattened gold wire. Backed with crimson silk."@en ;
        crmsci:O8_observed  <http://data.silknow.org/object/630da861-4229-3b92-8bab-707b1f42798c> .

